        Mapa
      </p>
      <a className="[word-break:break-word] absolute block cursor-pointer font-['Manrope:Bold'] font-bold leading-[0] left-[1232px] text-[14px] text-[color:var(--color-brand,#145c46)] top-[35px] whitespace-nowrap" data-node-id="53:758">
        <p className="leading-[20px]">Mi cuenta</p>
